      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.85;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:2rem;">The AYWC exists to connect independent study groups, organisations, and individual seekers across the globe — sharing news, events, translations, and insights to support each other on this path. We hold no hierarchy, charge no fees, and require no membership.</p>
